{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:10cbd3b148d59a4ebf0489941c7c89b5d9ec740106bb0035728f0eab3724a92b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb2ffa5ba424a4a7db0bb76a85d7612085b3a4cb47390e3455b1926e7b0351aa",
      "text": "晚上好，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2130df155fb43f2253c9b5ed71344a1ea93ae95f6f078a1b9222358aa90defa2",
      "text": "我想请教一下您对今天拍摄的感想，\n所以给您打了这通电话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0af40ae304107c015ee907f1f29f32917986b0d3c1b389bebdb193f4330abad1",
      "text": "在制作人看来，\n您觉得今天的拍摄怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47042593ea8d5146ea8f5c8f1e45689ee07ae5c7b2231cf6705bbfe28c505da8",
      "text": "大家都看起来\n非常开心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:833e40989a4015db357dee0ddf3258d30d010819402a24de66495813f7bf3e64",
      "text": "我觉得拍摄和采访\n都很不错！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be38869ac52cf338b11bfeba880bcfddfe88afd87689e8fc1bfa7688099e2acf",
      "text": "这样啊。\n其实，我有一点很在意的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1453172e1abd1d05a99e3957c4ef0f15a3ee5a0cacc197d0c3b339fd2ab95246",
      "text": "虽说是杂志采访但也算工作，\n像那样开开心心的真的合适吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81e3f608f3804a9c5bb20ac08f8ce12d70d1a5eabc8990b5669027921044c7bf",
      "text": "我稍微有点担心，\n自己是不是应该以更认真的态度去对待才对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b08855861027b71b5b30af612605b86128a2b04f4edb225d431d759d76266db3",
      "text": "……但是，听了制作人的感想，\n我现在觉得，那样做或许才是正确的了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62239280d6446a27e795fba97208c6e683d99b1f3bc5d91a6c9c21d0d8f1580e",
      "text": "当然，我想这也得视情况而定，\n但对我们来说，乐在其中也是很重要的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_302_2_3_021_02_09_a:2_3_021_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f171445c974cedd31511c6592e6adb80ec4a3ac3205a0fbcf48a21780cb66bf9",
      "text": "我不会忘记这次工作学到的东西，今后也会继续加油。\n今后也请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
